## Import

Configure the complete `parameters` object you want to retain before applying an imported installation. Import cannot recover Secret values; supply the values Terraform should manage. See [parameter ownership](#parameter-ownership) for omission behavior.

Choose one of the following methods. Match the resource address and Contentful IDs to your configuration, then review the plan before applying.
